      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Townville%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the 1859 oil boom, Noah Town supplied oak staves for oil barrels.",
