      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Townville%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Townville sits in a valley between north‑flowing Muddy Creek and south‑flowing Sugar Creek.",
